2.
Definitions.
- In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Academic and Activity Council" means the Academic and Activity Council of the University;
(b)
"academic staff" means such categories of staff as are designated as academic staff by the Ordinances;
(c)
"Board of Sports Studies" means the Board of Sports Studies of a Department of the University;
(d)
"Chancellor" means the Chancellor of the University;
(e)
"College" means a college or other academic institution established or maintained by, or admitted to the privileges of,
the University;
(f)
"Court" means the Court of the University;
(g)
"Department" means a Department of Studies and includes a Centre of Studies;
(h)
"employee" means any person appointed by the University and includes teachers and other staff of the University;
(i)
"Executive Council" means the Executive Council of the University;
(j)
"Finance Committee" means the Finance Committee of the University;
(k)
"Fund" means the University Fund referred to in section 30;
(l)
"Hall" means a unit of residence or of corporate life for the students of the University, or of an Outlying Campus or of a
College or an Institution, maintained by the University;
(m)
"Head of the Department" means the head of any teaching department of the University;
(n)
"Institution" means an academic institution, not being a College, maintained by, or admitted to the privileges of, the
University;

(o)
"Outlying Campus" means the campus of the University as may be established by it at any place within or outside India;
(p)
"Principal" means the Head of a College or an Institution maintained by the University and includes, where there is no
Principal, the person for the time being duly appointed to act as Principal, and in the absence of the Principal, or the
acting Principal, a Vice-Principal duly appointed as such;
(q)
"Regional Centre" means a centre established or maintained by the University for the purpose of coordinating and
supervising the work of Study Centres in any region and for performing such other functions as may be conferred on
such centre by the Executive Council;
